SUMMARY:Yesterday and Today: The Interactive Beatles Experience
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Step into the excitement of the British Invasion with Yesterday
  and Today: The Interactive Beatles Experience\, a nostalgic journey throu
 gh the music that changed everything. Created by brothers Billy\, Matthew 
 and Ryan McGuigan\, this isn’t a typical tribute concert—it’s a fan-
 driven celebration where the audience chooses the entire setlist. Before t
 he show\, guests submit their favorite Beatles songs along with the memori
 es behind them\, and moments later those requests shape a one-of-a-kind pe
 rformance.\nhttps://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/event/yesterday-and-toda
 y-the-interactive-beatles-experience/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://
 pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/event/yesterday-and-today-the-int
 eractive-beatles-experience/
END:VEVENT
